{"unit_id": "tag:0H3P:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拟紧（quasi-compact）、拟分离（quasi-separated）且支配（dominant）的态射（morphism），其源和目标都是概形（schemes）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 分解（factorization）<MATH_0002>由引理<REF_0001>第（2）项构造，是<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中的半正规化（seminormalization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 分解（factorization）<MATH_0005>由引理<REF_0002>第（1）项构造，是<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>中的弱正规化（weak normalization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "支配"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "factorization", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化"}, {"source_term": "factorization", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "所给态射的拟紧条件。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "所给态射的拟分离条件。"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "支配", "context": "所给态射的支配条件。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "具有所列三个性质的映射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给态射的源和目标。"}, {"source_term": "factorization", "target_term": "分解", "context": "引理第（2）项所构造的态射分解。"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化", "context": "第（2）项所构造分解的名称。"}, {"source_term": "factorization", "target_term": "分解", "context": "引理第（1）项所构造的态射分解。"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化", "context": "第（1）项所构造分解的名称。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3I:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面给出一种重新理解概形（scheme）的半正规化（seminormalization）的方法，其中该概形局部有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所讨论的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化", "context": "下文将重新表述的构造。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "局部仅有有限多个的分支。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），其每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的正规化（normalization）。则<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>中的半正规化（seminormalization）就是<MATH_0006>的半正规化（seminormalization）。写成公式即为<MATH_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所设的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "假设中量化的开集。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "每个所述开集仅有有限多个的分支。"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化", "context": "引理中设置的正规化对象。"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化", "context": "等式左侧的相对半正规化。"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化", "context": "等式右侧的半正规化。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3Q:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>如（<REF_0001>）中所述，从而<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中的正规化（normalization）。半正规化（seminormalization）<MATH_0005>取自<MATH_0006>，是一个始对象（initial object），其所在的范畴（category）由如下泛同胚（universal homeomorphisms）<MATH_0007>组成：它们在剩余域（residue fields）上诱导同构（isomorphisms）。由于<MATH_0008>是不交并（disjoint union），其各项为剩余域（residue fields）的谱（spectra），这些域取自<MATH_0009>的不可约分支（irreducible components）的泛点（generic points），所以对该范畴（category）中任意<MATH_0010>，我们都得到一个典范（canonical）的提升（lift）<MATH_0011>，其所提升的是<MATH_0012>。再由引理<REF_0002>，得到一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0013>。继而得到一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0014>，这是由<MATH_0015>的泛性质（universal property）给出的。由此可见，<MATH_0016>满足一项泛性质（universal property），与<MATH_0017>所具有的相同，结论随即成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化"}, {"source_term": "initial object", "target_term": "始对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphisms", "target_term": "泛同胚"}, {"source_term": "residue fields", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "residue fields", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化", "context": "证明起始处的相对正规化。"}, {"source_term": "seminormalization", "target_term": "半正规化", "context": "由始对象性质刻画的构造。"}, {"source_term": "initial object", "target_term": "始对象", "context": "刻画半正规化的范畴论对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "由满足所述域条件的泛同胚组成。"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphisms", "target_term": "泛同胚", "context": "构成所述范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "residue fields", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "这些泛同胚在其上诱导同构的域。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "泛同胚在剩余域上诱导的映射。"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "由各域的谱组成的并。"}, {"source_term": "residue fields", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "各不可约分支泛点处的域。"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "构成不交并的各域的谱。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "提供所取泛点的分支。"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "取剩余域的点。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "任取对象以得到提升的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰在此得到的提升。"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升", "context": "针对范畴中任意对象得到的提升。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "应用所引引理得到的态射。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "继而由泛性质得到的态射。"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "给出后一典范态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质", "context": "最后比较两个对象时所用的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3I:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n引理<REF_0001>引出了下面的定义。由于我们只在<MATH_0001>局部有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）的情形构造了正规化（normalization），对弱正规化（weak normalization），我们也只考虑这一情形。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "构造所限情形中局部仅有有限多个的分支。"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化", "context": "前文已构造的对象。"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化", "context": "同样限定在该情形的构造。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3R:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），其每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）。我们如下定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>弱正规化（weak normalization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>：对<MATH_0002>，取弱正规化（weak normalization）<MATH_0003>，这是对<MATH_0004>在正规化（normalization）<MATH_0005>中所作的，后者取自<MATH_0006>（定义<REF_0001>）。写成公式即为<MATH_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所设的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "定义假设中量化的开集。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "每个所述开集仅有有限多个的分支。"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化", "context": "此处定义的概形构造。"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化", "context": "用于给出定义的相对构造。"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化", "context": "进行相对弱正规化的正规化对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3I:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n结合引理<REF_0001>可知，对一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>，若它局部有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components），则存在典范（canonical）的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0002>\n有了这个定义，就可以说明一个概形（scheme）是弱（weakly）正规（normal）的含义（前提是它局部有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components））。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "weakly", "target_term": "弱"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "典范态射所涉及的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "存在所述态射的条件中局部仅有有限多个的分支。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰由所引引理和定义得到的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "公式列出的典范映射。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "下文将为之定义弱正规性的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "weakly", "target_term": "弱", "context": "与术语库存中的 normal 合成所引出的弱正规性质。"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "受 weakly 修饰，指下文将定义的弱正规性质。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "括号所述前提中局部仅有有限多个的分支。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H3S:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），其每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）。我们称<MATH_0002>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>弱正规（weakly normal）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，条件是弱正规化（weak normalization）<MATH_0003>是一个同构（isomorphism）（定义<REF_0001>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "weakly normal", "target_term": "弱正规"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所设的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "定义假设中量化的开集。"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "每个所述开集仅有有限多个的分支。"}, {"source_term": "weakly normal", "target_term": "弱正规", "context": "此处通过弱正规化是否为同构来定义的性质。"}, {"source_term": "weak normalization", "target_term": "弱正规化", "context": "所引定义给出的态射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "定义中要求弱正规化态射具有的性质。"}], "notes": []}
